  <section class="faq-section">
    <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
    <details>
      <summary>Is there a dispensary in Standish, Maine?</summary>
      <p>Yes. Lakewood Cannabis lists a medical cannabis store at 234 Northeast Road, Unit 15, Standish.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Does Standish allow adult-use cannabis stores?</summary>
      <p>No. Standish Chapter 220 expressly prohibits adult-use retail stores and several other adult-use establishment categories. The ordinance separately preserves lawful medical-use activity.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Is Lakewood Cannabis medical or adult-use?</summary>
      <p>Medical. OCP's June 1, 2026 medical-establishment file lists active Standish registration DSP184, and Lakewood's own site identifies the operation as medical retail.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>What should I verify before visiting?</summary>
      <p>Check the operator's current hours and menu, and confirm that your medical credential and identification meet current OCP requirements.</p>
    </details>
  </section>

